/* pages/queue-info/settings.wxss */
/* 排版和「我的 - 各类二级页」保持一致：浅灰底 + 白色卡片 + 16rpx 圆角 */

.settings-page {
  min-height: 100vh;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  padding: 24rpx 24rpx 60rpx;
  background: #f6f6f6;
  color: #333;
}

/* ============ 当前机台 ============ */
.machine-bar {
  padding: 8rpx 12rpx 28rpx;
}
.machine-name {
  font-size: 40rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #1f2329;
  line-height: 1.4;
  word-break: break-all;
}
.machine-sub {
  margin-top: 6rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: #8a9099;
}

/* ============ 分组卡片 ============ */
.group {
  background: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 20rpx;
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 4rpx 16rpx rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
}
.group-title {
  padding: 26rpx 28rpx 6rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: #9aa0a6;
  letter-spacing: 1rpx;
}

/* ============ 单元格 ============ */
.cell {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 16rpx;
  padding: 26rpx 28rpx;
  border-top: 1rpx solid #f0f1f3;
}
/* 分组里的第一行不需要分割线 */
.cell-first {
  border-top: none;
}
.cell-hover {
  background: #f7f8fa;
}
/* 没资格点的行（例如不在本机台队列里时的「强制下机」）：
   只降透明度、不设 disabled —— 点下去还要弹一句「为什么不能点」 */
.cell-disabled {
  opacity: 0.45;
}
.cell-body {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
}
.cell-label {
  font-size: 30rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: #1f2329;
  line-height: 1.4;
}
.cell-desc {
  margin-top: 6rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: #9aa0a6;
  line-height: 1.4;
}
.cell-arrow {
  flex: none;
  font-size: 34rpx;
  line-height: 1;
  color: #c4c9cf;
  transition: transform 0.2s ease-out;
}
/* 展开时箭头朝下 */
.cell-arrow-open {
  transform: rotate(90deg);
  color: #07c160;
}

/* ============ 强制下机面板 ============ */
.force-panel {
  padding: 4rpx 28rpx 24rpx;
  background: #fbfcfd;
  border-top: 1rpx solid #f0f1f3;
}
.force-head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 20rpx 0 12rpx;
}
.force-title {
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: #9aa0a6;
}
.force-refresh {
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: #007aff;
  padding: 6rpx 10rpx;
}
.force-tip {
  padding: 24rpx 0;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: #9aa0a6;
  text-align: center;
}

.force-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 20rpx;
  padding: 20rpx 0;
  border-top: 1rpx solid #f0f1f3;
}
.force-avatar {
  flex: none;
  width: 76rpx;
  height: 76rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #e9ecef;
}
.force-info {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
}
.force-name {
  font-size: 28rpx;
  color: #1f2329;
  font-weight: 500;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.force-meta {
  margin-top: 4rpx;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: #9aa0a6;
}
.force-btn {
  flex: none;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0 24rpx;
  min-width: 0;
  height: 56rpx;
  line-height: 56rpx;
  border-radius: 28rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: #ffffff;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e53935, #f2726f);
  box-shadow: 0 2rpx 10rpx rgba(229, 57, 53, 0.28);
}
.force-btn:active {
  box-shadow: 0 1rpx 6rpx rgba(229, 57, 53, 0.4);
}
/* 执行中（其余按钮禁用）：WXSS 对 [disabled] 属性选择器支持不可靠，用 class 控制 */
.force-btn-disabled {
  opacity: 0.55;
}

/* 「全部下机」：面板级的一次性操作，整行铺开，和每行的「下机」区分开。
   用浅红底 + 红字（不是实心红），避免和上面每行的实心「下机」抢注意力。 */
.force-all-btn {
  margin: 22rpx 0 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 76rpx;
  line-height: 76rpx;
  border-radius: 38rpx;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: #e53935;
  background: rgba(229, 57, 53, 0.08);
}
.force-all-btn:active {
  background: rgba(229, 57, 53, 0.16);
}
/* 按钮自带的伪元素描边会和外层卡片边框打架，去掉 */
.force-all-btn::after {
  border: none;
}

/* ============ 切换拼机面板（和强制下机共用 .force-* 的行/头像/说明样式） ============ */
.multi-btn {
  flex: none;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0 22rpx;
  min-width: 0;
  height: 56rpx;
  line-height: 56rpx;
  border-radius: 28rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: #ffffff;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1677ff, #5aa9ff);
  box-shadow: 0 2rpx 10rpx rgba(22, 119, 255, 0.28);
}
.multi-btn:active {
  box-shadow: 0 1rpx 6rpx rgba(22, 119, 255, 0.4);
}
/* 昵称后面的「我」小标签 */
.multi-me {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-left: 10rpx;
  padding: 0 10rpx;
  border-radius: 6rpx;
  font-size: 20rpx;
  line-height: 32rpx;
  color: #07c160;
  background: rgba(7, 193, 96, 0.1);
  vertical-align: middle;
}

.force-note {
  margin-top: 16rpx;
  padding-top: 16rpx;
  border-top: 1rpx solid #f0f1f3;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: #b0b6bd;
  line-height: 1.6;
}
.force-note-strong {
  color: #e53935;
}

/* ============ 页脚 ============ */
.page-tip {
  padding: 36rpx 12rpx 0;
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: #b8bec4;
}
